                                "sense_id": "a6ff5497-6ddd-3a6a-ad94-c84434999975",
                                "text": "Her seductiveness came from her apparent innocence."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "9958bf5d-7ba5-408f-9fc2-a9e4a9e6adf1",
                                "sense_id": "a6ff5497-6ddd-3a6a-ad94-c84434999975",
                                "text": "Biblical criteria of sexual seductiveness include a white skin, black hair, or henna-dyed, scarlet lips, a prominent nose, rosy temples, long straight neck, firm breasts, round thighs, an erect posture."
                            },
