                                "sense_id": "a6ff5497-6ddd-3a6a-ad94-c84434999975",
                                "text": "She brought a tigresslike seductiveness and a husky-voiced irreverence to roles as worldly, devil-may-care women, becoming adept at playing exotic vamps and free-spirited protagonists, […]"
